Z||000011||Spektrum-87GT||11-02-2001||06:37 PM||||i built sealed boxes, turned out great... just a little too big for the fiero. They're still in my car and man to they hit insanely hard, not too good on the bass 'hum' though. i'm speaking from experience here, build for quality, not quanity, because the fiero is WAY to small for big sound. Your brain and ears will thank you when its over. As a matter of fact, I'm taking out my boxes tomorrow, and they're staying out. 780 watts and 8 speakers is too much!||||reg||1
